SUMMARY:CHECKPOINT 5
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270131
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270201
DTSTAMP:20260809T120000Z
UID:c28b6b9656b42078c2134e172e80abd8@fuf-romain
SEQUENCE:6
DESCRIPTION:Dossier FUF depose complet\, frais payes\, aller-retour Brist
 ol-Palaiseau reserve\, Bristol prevenu de ton absence en mai. Plan a 10 
 h : ch. 13 (integration) clos\, ch. 16 (series numeriques) en cours \; p
 remier ADS en conditions fait.\nEn retard ? Priorite absolue a l'adminis
 tratif.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
